    "relPath": "regressions/README.md",
    "content": "# regressions/\n\nInvestigation files for individual regressions. The canonical log lives in\n[`../10-regression-log.md`](../10-regression-log.md); create a file here (`REG-0XX-name.md`) when\na regression needs a full investigation trail (evidence, git archaeology, repro steps,\nresolution).\n\n**Each investigation should cover:** description, observed vs expected, evidence (commits,\nbranches, files), root cause, impact, fix/decision, verification, and final status.\n\nOpen regressions to potentially deep-dive: REG-001/002/003 (Team — verify on `master`),\nREG-006 (Blocked vs Waiting — fixed by the Execution Status Engine when wired).\n\nEmpty for now — investigation files are added as regressions are worked.\n"
