    "relPath": "specs/README.md",
    "content": "# specs/\n\nDetailed feature & technical specifications. Create one file per feature **when it is being\ndesigned or significantly changed** — before writing code (AI rule #2/#11).\n\n**Naming:** `SPEC-<area>-<short-name>.md` (e.g. `SPEC-status-engine-living-graph-wiring.md`).\n\n**Each spec should cover:** problem, expected behavior, affected Capability/Feature IDs,\ndata/schema, APIs/surfaces, dependencies, regression risks, test plan, related ADRs, rollout.\n\nEmpty for now — specs are added as work is planned.\n"
